  "details": "The order of my favorite worlds list does not display correctly on the web.\n\nIn the VRChat app, worlds1 through worlds4 display in the correct order.\n\nHowever, when logging in via the web, the order of worlds3 and worlds4 is reversed.\n\nThis is not a naming error; the list URL itself is actually reversed for 3 and 4.\n\nClearing browser cache and history, or changing the browser or device used, does not restore the correct order on the web.\n\nNone of my friends seem to have this issue, but I've been dealing with this for about a year and a half now.",
